  "title": "Colors, describing things, and adjective agreement",
  "note": "Adjectives agree with their noun in gender. Nominative singular endings: -y for masculine (nowy dom), -a for feminine (nowa książka), -e for neuter (nowe okno). After k and g the masculine ending is -i and the neuter -ie: wysoki dom, wysokie drzewo, drogi samochód, drogie wino.",
